### Compliance Review — ComplianceReviewAgent
### POST /api/compliance/review
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### High risk: several flagged terms → ESCALATE path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compliance/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewId": "REV-20001",
  "documentText": "The vendor accepts unlimited liability. This contract will auto-renew annually. An exclusive indemnity applies to all downstream claims.",
  "jurisdiction": "EU"
}

###

### Clean document: no flagged terms → isClean branch → CLEAR path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compliance/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewId": "REV-20002",
  "documentText": "Standard mutual terms apply. Either party may terminate with thirty days written notice.",
  "jurisdiction": "US"
}

###

### Single flagged term → hasFlaggedClauses branch at the REMEDIATE threshold
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compliance/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewId": "REV-20003",
  "documentText": "The supplier grants an exclusive distribution right for the territory.",
  "jurisdiction": "CH"
}

###

### Two flagged terms → higher risk score, still REMEDIATE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compliance/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewId": "REV-20004",
  "documentText": "A non-compete clause binds the contractor. The agreement will auto-renew unless cancelled.",
  "jurisdiction": "DE"
}
